msgid "Send and track WordPress email through the full Email surface in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from a qualifying Gravity account."
msgstr "Envie e acompanhe e-mails do WordPress pela área completa de E-mail no Minn. Descarregue o ficheiro .zip do plugin em uma conta Gravity qualificada."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10378
msgid "Manage the Perfmatters settings estate from Minn's Performance surface. Download the paid plugin .zip from Perfmatters."
msgstr "Gerencie todo o conjunto de definições do Perfmatters pela área Desempenho do Minn. Descarregue o ficheiro .zip do plugin pago no Perfmatters."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10390
msgid "Bring ACF PRO repeaters, flexible content, galleries, options pages, blocks, and field groups into Minn. Download the plugin .zip from ACF."
msgstr "Traga repetidores, conteúdo flexível, galerias, páginas de opções, blocos e grupos de campos do ACF PRO para o Minn. Descarregue o ficheiro .zip do plugin no ACF."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10402
msgid "Manage Elementor form submissions in Minn while keeping Elementor-owned page content protected. Download the plugin .zip from Elementor."
msgstr "Gerencie envios de formulários do Elementor no Minn enquanto mantém protegido o conteúdo de página pertencente ao Elementor. Descarregue o ficheiro .zip do plugin no Elementor."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10414
msgid "Manage WPForms Pro entries, read and starred state, spam, trash, search, and form filters in Minn. Download the plugin .zip from WPForms."
msgstr "Gerencie entradas do WPForms Pro, estado de leitura e destaque, spam, lixo, pesquisa e filtros de formulário no Minn. Descarregue o ficheiro .zip do plugin no WPForms."

#: includes/class-minn-admin-rest.php:10426
msgid "Clear WP Rocket caches from Minn and monitor its license alongside other paid components. Download the plugin .zip from WP Rocket."
